摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Codex integration plugin for DeepSeek Harness, providing native Codex conversations powered by the Codex App Server, with workspace, terminal, approval, and DSH tool support.","id":"gh:1343529215","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"relay-dsh-plugin-codex","slug":"yangbobo2021/relay-dsh-plugin-codex","topics":["ai-agent","codex","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","openai","plugin","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Codex integration plugin for DeepSeek Harness, providing native Codex conversations powered by the C"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"odex App Server, with workspace, terminal, approval, and DSH tool support."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Codex Conversations for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> **Stable `0.2.4` is verified on official DSH `0.1.5-rc.2` and `0.1.6-alpha.1`.** It refreshes Code"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"x models after runtime changes and keeps enhanced mode usable when DSH contributes `mcp__`-prefixed "},{"id":"p3s3","text":"tools, while preserving the compatibility guarantees from `0.2.3`. Install it from npm · Compatibili"},{"id":"p3s4","text":" preserving the compatibility guarantees from `0.2.3`. Install it from npm · Compatibility evidence."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> **Release channels:** `latest` → `0.2.4`; `next` → `0.2.5-rc.1`."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**npm package:** `relay-dsh-plugin-codex`\n· All Relay DSH plugins"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**Run Codex inside official DeepSeek Harness without switching interfaces or\nmaintaining a DSH fork."},{"id":"p8s2","text":"Run Codex inside official DeepSeek Harness without switching interfaces or\nmaintaining a DSH fork.**"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"`relay-dsh-plugin-codex` adds **Codex as a native conversation backend** to the\nofficial DeepSeek Ha"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"rness\n(DSH) Web UI. You keep DSH's workspace, conversation history, composer,\napprovals, and tools w"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"hile each DSH Session continues one Codex App Server\nThread. The plugin installs independently; no R"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"elay checkout is required."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Try It on Official DSH"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Authenticate with an official Codex client before the first Session. Codex CLI\nusers can run:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The install requires Node.js 22.13 or newer and `pnpm` on `PATH`. Stop DSH Web,\ninstall the stable p"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"lugin, and restart DSH:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Open **New Session**, select a workspace, choose **Codex** from the mode menu,\nand send a message."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The screenshot was captured from official DSH `0.1.1-rc.2` with the Codex and\nClaude plugins install"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ed. If you install only this plugin, only **Codex** is\nadded."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Watch Plugin Manager find and install this package in 40 seconds\n· review all Relay DSH plugins"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"If this removes an interface switch from your DSH workflow,\nstar this plugin and\nshare your DSH vers"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ion or install feedback.\nThat signal helps other DSH users find a tested Codex backend."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Do I Need This Plugin?"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Install it when you want to:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- use Codex inside DSH instead of switching to a separate Codex interface;\n- keep DSH's native conve"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"rsation history, composer, approvals, and questions;\n- let one DSH Session continue the same Codex A"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"pp Server Thread across turns;\n- use Codex models, reasoning effort, images, interruption, and DSH-c"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"ontributed\ntools in the same conversation."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"You do not need it to use DSH's standard agents. It also does not add Relay\nEvents, file browsing, o"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"r a terminal panel. Those are separate optional plugins."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Complete Setup and Compatibility"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"The steps below were validated with:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- DeepSeek Harness `0.1.1-rc.2`, commit\n`b150a551`\n- Node.js 22.13 or newer\n- `pnpm` available on `P"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"epSeek Harness `0.1.1-rc.2`, commit\n`b150a551`\n- Node.js 22.13 or newer\n- `pnpm` available on `PATH`"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"DSH is currently a developer preview and may introduce compatibility-breaking\nchanges. This reposito"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ry tracks official releases and records its tested version\nhere."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### 1. Prepare Codex authentication"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"The plugin installs a pinned official `@openai/codex` runtime and launches it in\nApp Server mode. By"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" default, DSH first probes the local ChatGPT/Codex App\nexecutable and PATH candidates, then falls ba"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"ck to the bundled official\n`@openai/codex` runtime. The bundled runtime contains native binaries for"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"\nmacOS, Windows, and Linux on x64 and arm64, so DSH does not require a global\n`codex` command."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Codex authentication is still required. Install or open an official Codex\nclient and authenticate it"},{"id":"p29s2","text":" before starting your first DSH Codex session. When\nusing the CLI, verify the shared local credentia"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"starting your first DSH Codex session. When\nusing the CLI, verify the shared local credentials with:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"See the official Codex CLI guide and\nauthentication documentation for\ninstallation and sign-in optio"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"ns. Credentials stay under Codex's normal local\nauthentication mechanism; this plugin does not colle"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"ct them. Installing this\nplugin supplies its App Server runtime, but does not add a global `codex` s"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"alling this\nplugin supplies its App Server runtime, but does not add a global `codex` shell\ncommand."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### 2. Choose a package source and install"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Stop a running DSH Web process before changing Profile bundles. Choose one of\nthe following sources."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"#### Stable npm release"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"The published npm package name is\n`relay-dsh-plugin-codex`.\nUse `@latest` to install the current sta"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"d npm package name is\n`relay-dsh-plugin-codex`.\nUse `@latest` to install the current stable release:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"At the time of writing, `latest` resolves to stable version `0.2.4`. The linked\nnpm page is the sour"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"ce of truth for the current version."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"#### npm prerelease (recommended during DSH preview)"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Use `@next` to try the newest release candidate that has passed the repository's\nCI publishing and o"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"fficial DSH compatibility checks. The current candidate also\ncontains the bundled cross-platform App"},{"id":"p39s3","text":" Server runtime, so DSH does not depend\non a global `codex` executable:"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## What Works"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"- One persistent Codex App Server Thread per DSH Session\n- Model and reasoning-effort selection\n- St"},{"id":"p43s2","text":"reaming answers and reasoning in the native DSH conversation\n- Live output from long-running Codex s"},{"id":"p43s3","text":"hell commands in newly created Sessions, retained in DSH history\n- DSH approval and user-question fl"},{"id":"p43s4","text":"ows\n- Images, interruption, and continuation\n- Generic DSH tools exposed under the Codex App Server "},{"id":"p43s5","text":"`dsh` namespace\n- Optional terminal transport when the separate Relay terminal plugin is present"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"Tools execute through the owning Agent's DSH tool runtime and remain subject to\nDSH permissions and "},{"id":"p44s2","text":"Codex approval behavior."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"DSH MCP tools whose names begin with Codex's reserved `mcp__` prefix receive a\nstable `relay_mcp__` "},{"id":"p45s2","text":"wire alias during enhanced-mode registration. Calls are\nmapped back to the original DSH name, so the"},{"id":"p45s3","text":" MCP capability remains available.\nOrdinary DSH tool names are unchanged; native mode continues to o"},{"id":"p45s4","text":"y remains available.\nOrdinary DSH tool names are unchanged; native mode continues to omit DSH tools."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
